VED_DATE x 0 9cm  The specimen is inked entirely in black  and serially sectioned to reveal diffusely dense tan white to tan yellow rubbery tissue  with focal areas of adipose tissue  located predominantly in the deepest aspect of the specimen  REMOVED_DATE to 2 5cm from the skin surface  No focally distinct firmer areas are appreciated  The denser areas abut the inked margin  Representative sections of the specimen are submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Gross Dictation by Aliyah Rahemtullah M D   on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Aliyah Rahemtullah M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Review by Dennis Sgroi M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Review by Atul K Bhan M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Dennis Sgroi M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE RESULTS OF IMMUNOHISTOCHEMICAL STAINING FOR RECEPTOR PROTEINS Breast  Right  block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    The tumor cells stain for estrogen receptor protein  The tumor cells stain for progesterone receptor protein  The tumor cells show moderate  2   strong overexpression of HER 2 c erbB 2  See note  Breast  Left  block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    The tumor cells stain for estrogen receptor protein  The tumor cells stain for progesterone receptor protein  The tumor cells show moderate  2   overexpression of HER 2 c erbB 2  See note  Note  These tests were developed and their performance characteristics determined by the Pathology Department at the Massachusetts General Hospital  They have not been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Addendum by Atul K Bhan M D   on REMOVED_DATE Addendum  1 by Atul K Bhan M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE RESULTS OF FLUORESCENCE IN SITU HYBRIDIZATION  FISH  FOR HER 2 NEU GENE AMPLIFICATION Breast  Right  block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    HER 2 neu gene in tumor cells  REMOVED_DATE  Not Amplified   Se