pect of the specimen measuring 0 2cm from the closest inferior resection margin  0 2cm from the closest superior resection margin  abutting the anterior resection and measuring 0 2cm from the posterior margin  0 1cm from the lateral resection margin and 2 1cm from the medial resection margin  The specimen is sequentially submitted from medial to lateral as follows  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Medial resection margin  en face   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Parenchyma with anterior posterior superior inferior margins   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Parenchyma with soft white nodule in the medial aspect   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Multiple representative sections of breast parenchyma   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Red cystic lesion with associated calcifications and adjacent margins   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lateral margin  radial sections   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Remainder of specimen  Received fresh  labeled  right breast anterior   are three oriented yellow tan fragments of soft tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm  and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm with stitches designating the new margin  The new margin is inked black  All three specimens are submitted entirely in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  right breast final posterior   are three oriented fragments of red tan soft tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm  and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm with stitches designating the new margin  The new margins are inked black  The entire specimen is submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  right breast final medial   are three oriented fragments of red tan soft tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm with stitches designating the new margin  The new margins are inked black  The specimen is sectioned and entirely submitted in casse