ft and tan  Section Code A   posterior deep margin B   inferior deep margin  1 5cm inferior to the nipple C E   representative mass F   biopsy site G   scarred skin with the biopsy site H   nipple I   breast parenchyma adjacent to mass  medial J   breast parenchyma adjacent to mass  lateral K L   axillary lymph nodes Resident  Metin Ozdemirli  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  David L Berger  M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST AND AXILLA   report_end  , Unchecked.
