tion margin is 0 5cm from the indurated skin area   the inferior skin resection margin is 0 4cm from the indurated skin area  Medial   lateral skin   soft tissue resection margins are grossly unremarkable  lateral is 7cm from the indurated area   the medial is 11cm from the indurated area  The specimen is sectioned   submitted as follows  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Posterior resection margin closest to the suspicious area   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of the suspicious area under the skin induration   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Sections from the indurated skin from medial to lateral   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Superior skin   soft tissue margin closest to the indurated skin area  radially   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Inferior skin   soft tissue resection margin closest to the indurated skin area  radially   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   6 candidate lymph nodes  3 per cassette  in toto   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of grossly unremarkable parenchyma   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional representative sections of axillary tissue  Final Diagnosis by David C Wilbur M D   on Wednesday REMOVED_MONTH 07   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 03 42 01PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  Amendment  1 by David C Wilbur M D   Electronically signed on Friday REMOVED_MONTH 09   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 09 41 12AM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  PART   Breast  Right   Modified Radical Mastectomy  report_end  , Unchecked.
