in  and 3cm superomedially from the areola complex  A REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm dark brown macule abuts one skin margin at the inferior aspect  Sectioning beneath the linear  puckered superomedial scar reveals a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm predominantly smooth  gray pink biopsy cavity which comes within 0 1cm of the closest deep margin  The biopsy cavity comes to within 0 8cm of the overlying scar and 1 0cm from the superior margin  The tissue surrounding the biopsy cavity is focally indurated with diffuse bright yellow changes in the parenchyma  A REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm smooth lined cystic area located 0 9cm below the healed curvilinear scar  There is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm tan  diffusely granular firm area of fibrous tissue 3cm from the lateral margin  the closest margin   Additionally  there are two firm  ill  defined nodules each averaging 0 6cm in greatest dimension which come within 1 5cm of the lateral margin  SECTION CODE L  Biopsy cavity beneath puckered scar in relation to closest deep margin  M  Biopsy cavity in relation to puckered scar  N O  Biopsy cavity beneath puckered scar with adjacent indurated yellow parenchyma  P  Biopsy cavity beneath puckered scar in relation to adjacent firm fibrous tissue  Q R  Second well healed cystic biopsy cavity beneath curvilinear scar submitted in its entirety  S  Representative section of firm  granular focus in the lateral portion  T  Nodule from lateral area  U  Macule from skin ellipse  Gross Description by  JANINE L  DUDAC Resident  JUSTIN M  CATES  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Michael V Seiden  M D  Simon Powell  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY PART B  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLA  ADDITIONAL    EXCISION PART C  BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Unchecked.
