nd unit number only  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 6 8cm portion of fatty breast tissue  There is a short suture designating the superior aspect and a long suture designating the lateral aspect  The specimen is entirely inked black and overinked as follows  superior in red  inferior in green  lateral in blue  medial in yellow  and posterior in orange  The specimen is sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 8cm grey white  focally gritty  focally soft tumor located 2 5cm from the superior margin  red   1 7cm from the inferior margin  green   1 3cm from the posterior margin  orange   1 4cm from the anterior margin  black   1 2cm from the medial margin  yellow   and 1 4cm from the lateral margin  blue   Representative sections are submitted  Section code  C  superior margin D  tumor to inferior margin E  tumor to posterior margin F  tumor to anterior margin G  tumor to lateral margin  radial section  H  radial sections of medial margin I  section from central portion of tumor  J  additional section of tumor to posterior margin Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast final shavings   are multiple irregular fragments of predominantly adipose tissue aggregating REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  Representative sections are submitted in cassettes K N  Gross Description by  PAMELA ROMAN     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1 AND  1A  LYMPH NODE  LEFT SENTINEL   THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  2  LYMPH NODE  LEFT SENTINEL  LOW AXILLA   THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  GROSS DIAGNOSIS FOR  3  BREAST  EXCISION  CARCINOMA  GREATER THAN REMOVED_DATE CM FROM ALL MARGINS  O R  Resident  IVANA DELALLE  MD  PHD O R  Diagnosis by  Andrew Eric Rosenberg  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Arlan F Fuller Jr  