d in cassettes E J  The area with the clip is in cassette H  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final shaved margins  superior REMOVED_DATE of cavity left breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm aggregate of tan yellow fibrofatty breast tissue which is serially sectioned and submitted in its entirety in cassettes L N  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final shaved margins  inferior REMOVED_DATE of cavity from left breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm aggregate of tan yellow fibrofatty breast tissue which is serially sectioned and submitted in its entirety in cassettes O Q  Gross Description by  RYAN W  SCHNIEDERJAN Resident  PAUL MICHAELS  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST LEFT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  BREAST LEFT SHAVED MARGIN SUPERIOR REMOVED_DATE CAVITY  EXC PART C  BREAST LEFT SHAVED MARGIN INFERIOR REMOVED_DATE CAVITY  EXC , Unchecked.
