hich grossly abuts the inferior inked margin and lies 1 5cm from anterior  2 0cm from posterior  0 8cm from superior  0 7cm from lateral and 3 5cm from medial margin  There is REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm tan white  nodular area 0 5cm medial to the first mass which grossly abuts the inferior margin and lies 0 7cm from posterior  1 5cm from anterior  0 8cm from superior  1 5cm from lateral and 2 0cm from medial margin  The breast parenchyma that lies between the mass and the second ill defined contains the metallic clip  The second metallic clip is not appreciated grossly  The rest of the breast parenchyma contains tan white  fibrous tissue  No additional discrete mass or lesion is noted  Representative sections are submitted as follows  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Radial section  lateral margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entire first tan white mass   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Cross section  breast parenchyma containing metallic clip   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entire second tan white ill defined area   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections  breast parenchyma away from mass   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   En face section  medial margin  Received are nine containers  which are all  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  Received in formalin  labeled  right breast margin anterior final margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm aggregate of unoriented fibrofatty tissue which is serially sectioned and entirely submitted in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin  labeled  right deep margin right breast final margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm aggregate of unoriented fibrofatty tissue which is serially sectioned and entirely submitted in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin  labeled  right breast margin lateral   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm tan yellow to pink lobulated portion of fibrofatty tissue  There is a black suture along one aspect which is inked black  The specimen is serially section