stablished and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  10 REMOVED_MONTH 02 at 15 44 Consulting Pathologist s   Grace T  McKee MD GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  right axilla and breast  is a 40 x 26 x 5cm right modified radical mastectomy specimen with a 25 x 18cm overlying skin ellipse and 14 x 11 x 3cm axillary content  The specimen is inked black and sectioned to reveal a poorly defined 8 x 5 x 4cm area at the medial aspect of the specimen  which appears to be firm with multiple punctate areas of hard consistency  No biopsy site is identified  The remaining breast tissue is fibrofatty  Multiple axillary lymph nodes  ranging from 0 3cm x 1 2cm in largest dimension  are identified  Representative sections are submitted  Section code  A F  Sampling of the firm area G  Deep resection margin en face  representative sections H I  Representative sections from unremarkable breast tissue J  One bisected lymph node K  Trisected lymph node L  One bisected lymph node M  Lymph nodes N Q  One bisected lymph node in each R  Lymph nodes S X  Additional sections of the firm area  Resident  DI TIAN  MD  PhD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Sarah P Thayer  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY , Unchecked.
